  "comments": "<p>This coin was popularly known as “lenteja” (lentil) due to its small size, necessitated by its low value. The design was created by the Royal Mint of Madrid's engraver, Luis Antonio García Ruiz, who splendidly resolved all the challenges encountered in including the necessary information in the limited space allowed by the coin.</p><p>1997 coin, plus or X different. Can be a different variant.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/68c508976a358.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/68c508976a358.jpg\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/68c508cd14ffe.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/68c508cd14ffe.jpg\"></a></p>",
